          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a motion-graphics text reveal about street food.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with flickering firelight as the only motivated source and grade to a neutral commercial grade with clean whites and no colour cast.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
